//Tableau Data Sources
Tableau can connect to many categories of data sources, including:
• Excel files.
• CSV and text files.
• Relational databases.
• Cloud data sources.
• Published data sources.
• Other supported enterprise and analytical systems.
After connecting to a source, users can inspect field names, data types and sample values. Data
preparation may include renaming fields, changing types, filtering records, joining or relating data, creating
calculations and removing unwanted records.//

